  "description": "The native payload for Agora's 3D spatial audio extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_macOS 4.7.0 archive and packaged for .NET for macOS. Places each remote speaker somewhere around the listener's head, so a call or a game world has direction and distance rather than one flat mix. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Mac or Net.Agora.Voice.Mac — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraLocalSpatialAudioKit in the RTC binding.",
